# sitting-depth verification — raw literal log

Scope: past-exam picker + period filter on decided taxonomy (examYear INT NULL,
sittingLabel TEXT NULL on questions; no papers table; source enum untouched;
module-scoped unit multi-select untouched).
No prose verdicts below — command + literal output only.

Code footprint (new vs prior task):
  prisma/schema.prisma                  (+2 nullable columns on Question)
  prisma/migrations/20260101000019_add_question_sitting_columns/migration.sql (new)
  src/lib/question-filters.ts           (+examYear/examYearFrom/examYearTo/sittingLabel)
  src/routes/sessions.routes.ts         (+4 schema params + passthrough only)
  src/routes/questions.routes.ts        (+list passthrough; +counts params/sittings)
  web/src/lib/types.ts                  (+sittings on QuestionCountsResponse)
  web/src/components/SessionBuilder.tsx (+Examen passé section, picker, period)
  web/src/app/qcm/builder/QcmBuilderClient.tsx (+4 field forwards)

Screenshots (live localhost:3001 DOM):
  docs/verification/sitting-depth-zero-picker.png (empty hint, untagged data)
  docs/verification/sitting-depth-picked.png      (picker state, viewport top)
  docs/verification/sitting-depth-session.png     (player after sitting submit)

